*Meeting With Teacher*

Miss Smith and Little Johnny's father were having a parent teacher
conference.

Miss Smith said to Little Johnny's father, "Well, at least there's one
thing I can say about your son."

Little Johnny's father asked, "What's that?"

"With grades like these, he couldn't possibly be cheating."

